{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/0f5ead1b7ce7fdaea8334d0b2b89255f.avif?t=1767230523\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spiritual successor to Freelancer, Underspace is an open-world sandbox RPG with a Lovecraftian twist, where every star system is handcrafted, and every star system has something to see or do. Jump into the bizarre galaxy of Croft, step into the role you want, and thrive alone or online with friends (multiplayer on near term Early Access roadmap). But beware! The storms rule the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a miner picking through crystallized bones of ancient star beasts, a trader hauling artifacts to far-flung outposts, a pirate robbing spacetrains, an explorer combing through lost stellar cities, or a hunter chasing down unknowable monstrosities that spew forth from the storms. Brave violent weather, eldritch beasts, and the terrors of the unknown as you make your mark in the universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/5e2111bd8c092ee2d24292ee09da976b.poster.avif?t=1767230523\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/5e2111bd8c092ee2d24292ee09da976b.webm?t=1767230523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/5e2111bd8c092ee2d24292ee09da976b.mp4?t=1767230523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 main campaign missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 sidequests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >114 star systems (no fast travel - all open world + lanelines for accelerated travel)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >204 stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >533 equipment pieces to customize your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player housing and extensive cockpit customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >68 enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~12-15 hours to beat the main quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 300 hours of gameplay for a completionist</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILL THE STORM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is not a safe, sane place. Hyperspatial tempests sweep through space, distorting star systems and spewing forth strange hazards, even stranger monstrosities, and incredible treasures. Traverse over 110 handcrafted star systems, any of which could fall victim to foul weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THOUSAND DEAD EMPIRES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike out into the starry unknown, and comb through ancient starcities, warped graveyards, or fields of lost wormholes. The galaxy is filled with unique adventures and puzzles waiting for a starchaser to discover and rob them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HERE THERE BE MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Away from the highways and deep in the most remote parts of space lie hidden challenges. you'll face off against world-eating serpents, possessed battleships, and living minefields. End the lives of over 35 unique bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/8d57b1702d14befa2a6738b50d1474f1.poster.avif?t=1767230523\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/8d57b1702d14befa2a6738b50d1474f1.webm?t=1767230523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/8d57b1702d14befa2a6738b50d1474f1.mp4?t=1767230523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR SHIP, YOUR CHOICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly, paint, and customize over 60 different ships. Outfit yourself with over 500 pieces of equipment. Choose your race, build your character, and try not to get eaten by a ghost train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY STAR A STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in the face of the great storms, life goes on. Befriend or befuddle over 40 different factions, all with their own alliances, goals, and preferences. Pursue random assignments, or discover hidden stories and questionable motives in over 45 unique sidequests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY STORY UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strip asteroids of their precious resources, fabricate technology to sell and utilize. Ship over 50 different types of cargo to over 200 stations, or pirate it off the imbeciles who stray into your territory. From dashing hero to dastardly hellpriest, experience the galaxy the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/6d88b50fbb8cc5316681fd6f2c6e4cce.poster.avif?t=1767230523\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/6d88b50fbb8cc5316681fd6f2c6e4cce.webm?t=1767230523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1111930/extras/6d88b50fbb8cc5316681fd6f2c6e4cce.mp4?t=1767230523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"6246fbeccf07aa42ccde9bc4b6bdda8be970264f.jpg","localized_name":"I\u2019m Going To Kill SO Many Pirates","name":"I\u2019m Going To Kill SO Many Pirates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1111930/6246fbeccf07aa42ccde9bc4b6bdda8be970264f.jpg"},{"icon":"30915153c4733098bf54e06695798a09b96b73ee.jpg","localized_name":"Crazy Rich Aliens","name":"Crazy Rich Aliens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1111930/30915153c4733098bf54e06695798a09b96b73ee.jpg"},{"icon":"9bad05e8bf4ba77480f0cfefc393f7dc0f371ab8.jpg","localized_name":"Master Starchaser","name":"Master Starchaser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1111930/9bad05e8bf4ba77480f0cfefc393f7dc0f371ab8.jpg"},{"icon":"d7b70cd48ccd2f5184029e9ddcabd0f688d7a9c2.jpg","localized_name":"Glitzy Garage","name":"Glitzy Garage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1111930/d7b70cd48ccd2f5184029e9ddcabd0f688d7a9c2.jpg"},{"icon":"ebe6f66b3504d87ef0ce339e67139313d202036f.jpg","localized_name":"Godhunter","name":"Godhunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1111930/ebe6f66b3504d87ef0ce339e67139313d202036f.jpg"},{"icon":"0f0ef5c53d4f086def4cdbf4b1894ec318f6fff3.jpg","localized_name":"Mass Data Extractor","name":"Mass Data Extractor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1111930/0f0ef5c53d4f086def4cdbf4b1894ec318f6fff3.jpg"},{"icon":"ca6a5bd35fff98e435337a417e8f7bc8c0c05165.jpg","localized_name":"Supreme Explorer","name":"Supreme Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1111930/ca6a5bd35fff98e435337a417e8f7bc8c0c05165.jpg"},{"icon":"028a4549567058c507694341a168c13f7dc72e7b.jpg","localized_name":"Arisen Anew","name":"Arisen Anew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic